  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Whole organism. Do not substitute a skull, slab or generic dinosaur. [\"Soft-tissue thickness and outline of dorsal crest are unknown; use modest narrow triangular skin-covered crest as an explicitly artistic choice, not a proven thin sail.\", \"Integument is not known over whole body. Neutral smooth faceted surface, no asserted all-over scaly pattern, no speculative elaborate feather fan.\", \"Colour, stance and soft-tissue volumes are artistic. Do not copy fossil death pose or a skeletal mount as a life pose.\"] {\"length_m\": 6.0, \"basis\": \"Approximate total length in NHM profile and 2010 description, not a precise measurement of every part.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Whole organism. Do not substitute a skull, slab or generic dinosaur. [\"Soft-tissue thickness and outline of dorsal crest are unknown; use modest narrow triangular skin-covered crest as an explicitly artistic choice, not a proven thin sail.\", \"Integument is not known over whole body. Neutral smooth faceted surface, no asserted all-over scaly pattern, no speculative elaborate feather fan.\", \"Colour, stance and soft-tissue volumes are artistic. Do not copy fossil death pose or a skeletal mount as a life pose.\"] {\"length_m\": 6.0, \"basis\": \"Approximate total length in NHM profile and 2010 description, not a precise measurement of every part.\"}"
  },
